==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**26,800 grants +5 Rare Catseyes.
**26,900 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
**27,000 grants +1 Rare Ticket.
*Renamed [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Headmistress Jeanne]] to "Jeanne", Headmistress Jeanne ψ to "Jeanne ψ", [[Amakusa Shiro (Uber Rare Cat)|Shiro Amakusa]] to "Amakusa Shiro" and [[Raclesa (Uber Rare Cat)|Raclesa the Lioness]] to "Raclesa".
*Readded Raclesa to the [[Cat Guide]] in international versions.
*Raised [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]]'s and [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation Cat]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Raised [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]]'s, [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]]'s and [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]]'s + level caps from +50 to +55.
*Raised [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]]'s + level cap from +40 to +45.
*Raised [[Lieutenant Cat (Special Cat)|Lieutenant Cat]]'s + level cap from +0 to +5.
*Added the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]] content from BCJP [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]] to international versions.
*Changed the Save Transfer screen so that it is more clear between account linking and code transfer.
*Auto Lineup generation made smarter.
*Added [[Meownesday]] event:
**Free [[Leadership]] on login
**[[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] XP areas open all day
**One random unit will have half XP upgrade costs up to level 30
***The [[Upgrade Menu]] will default to the selected unit when opened from the [[Cat Base Menu]]
***[[The Cat God (Special Cat)|The Cat God]] cannot be selected for having halved XP costs
**[[Treasure Festival]] and Half [[Cat Energy|Energy]] Cost for all [[Main Chapters Levels]] all day
**Half Energy Cost for [[Stories of Legend]] and [[Uncanny Legends]] stages all day
**Energy will be fully refunded after quitting even after 10 seconds have passed in [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed/Manic]]/[[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages|XP]] stages

